# KOBIN.TV / NNDD TV - STRICT CURSOR RULES & PERMANENT ARCHITECTURE

> DO NOT MODIFY, REMOVE, OR SIMPLIFY ANY OF THE FOLLOWING CORE FEATURES WITHOUT EXPLICIT USER APPROVAL.
> USER MANDATE: "ئەم سکیڵانە هەمووی خەزن بکە ئیتر بێ رەزامەندی من و ئاگەدار کردنەوەم دەستکاریان مەکە".

## 1. Landscape Lock (قوفڵ کردنی لاند سکەیپ)
- Always enforce landscape mode on mobile/tablet during live playback.
- Android Capacitor Manifest: `android:screenOrientation="sensorLandscape"` must always remain intact.

## 2. 5-Second Zapping Delay & Dual-Player Preload (زواپینگ بەس ٥ چرکەیی بە پلەیەر لە باکگراوند)
- Target channel previewed with animated circular countdown ring (`animate-ring-countdown-5s`).
- Dual-player background preload: inactive player decodes next stream in background; instant zero-black-screen transition on first frame.
- Automatic commit after 5 seconds or immediately on OK/Enter.

## 3. Double-Press OK for Channel Drawer (دوو جار ئۆکەی بۆ داخستنی لیستی کەناڵ)
- 1st click on channel in drawer: starts 5-second countdown, drawer stays open.
- 2nd click on same channel: commits channel switch and closes drawer.

## 4. Data Saver Mode (مۆدی کەم کردنەوەی مەسروفی ئینتەرنێت)
- Full quality control persisted in `localStorage('nndd_data_saver_mode')` (`auto`, `720p`, `data_saver`).

## 5. Tri-Lingual Virtual On-Screen Keyboard (تەختە کلیکی کوردی، ئینگلیزی و عەرەبی)
- 1-click switching between Kurdish (`[کوردی]`), English (`[EN]`), and Arabic (`[عربي]`).

## 6. Dashboard 60s Sleep State to 5 Pure White Small Wave Dots (خەوتنی داشبۆرد بۆ پێنچ خاڵی سپی پاش ٦٠ چرکە)
- After 60 seconds (1 minute) of inactivity on dashboard, buttons morph into 5 delicate glowing ocean wave dots.
- Any touch or remote key immediately restores normal dock buttons.

## 7. PIN 0000 Lock for Channel Editing, Moving & Deletion
- Modifying channels in drawer is locked behind PIN `0000` (or `1234`).
- Channel 1 (DABIN.Tv / `ch-dabin-tv-custom`) is permanently fixed at position #1 (`جێگیرە 🔒`).

## 8. Dashboard & Channel List Custom Scale Controls in Settings
- Dock scale slider (70% - 130%) and drawer scale options (`compact`, `standard`, `large`).

## 9. 4K Looping Video Background & Supabase Realtime Sync Engine
- Supports 4K looping video, wallpaper, and dark cinema tones.
- Direct sync with Supabase table `kobin_settings` (key: `theme_config`) via Realtime Pub/Sub.
- Multi-tier fallback: Supabase Cloud -> IndexedDB binary Blobs -> localStorage -> BroadcastChannel.
- Vercel deployment with `vercel.json` SPA rewrites and media cache headers.

## 10. Universal Multi-Platform Engine (Android TV + Tablet + Mobile Phone)
- Universal APK compatible with Google TV, Tablets (>=600dp), and Mobile phones.
- Non-destructive Home Launcher (`.TvLauncherAlias`) with `RoleManager.ROLE_HOME` on Android 10+.
- 2-Factor Exit Protocol (Gesture/Long-Press + 4-Digit PIN `0000`).
- Fallback packages for YouTube, Chrome, Google Play Store, and settings with web fallbacks.

## 11. 7-Day Electronic Program Guide (EPG Guide) & TMDB Enrichment
- Full interactive 7-Day EPG Guide modal (`EpgScheduleModal.jsx`).
- Automatic TMDB metadata enrichment for VOD movies and series.
